# Ship finished work

After a requested change is implemented and checked, commit it and push `origin main` in the same turn. Do not wait for a separate "push".

- This covers UI, layout, and other finished product changes on this repo.
- Push with `git push origin main` only. Do not run `npx vercel deploy --prod`.
- Do not commit secrets (`.env`, credentials, keys).
- Do not push if the user said to hold, or if the change is only a suggestion they have not asked to build.
